tools.description:
List Kromatic knowledge documents by category. Returns compact metadata (title, URL, resource_type) — no chunk text. Use this to browse what exists before retrieving details.

Available resource_types: Program, Module, Download, Tool, Blog Content, Book Section, MCP Server, Skill
Available source_keys: learning_library, tools_and_games, blog_content, real_startup_book

Examples:
- List all downloads: {"resource_types": ["Download"]}
- List all tools: {"resource_types": ["Tool"]}
- List the MCP servers: {"resource_types": ["MCP Server"]}
- List the packaged skills: {"resource_types": ["Skill"]}
- List all programs and modules: {"resource_types": ["Program", "Module"]}
- Browse learning library: {"source_keys": ["learning_library"]}
